OL,3,GNEWSACity's only community-run pub
OL,4,Acelebrates milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub co-owned by more than 600 people
OL,7,Fis celebrating its one-year
OL,8,Fanniversary.
OL,10,FThe New Clarence on Charles Street is
OL,11,Frun by the Hull Community Pub Society,
OL,12,Fwith each member paying #100 for their
OL,13,Fshare.
OL,15,FThe pub, which marked the occasion with
OL,16,Fa party earlier, became vacant in 2023,
OL,17,Fsparking a campaign by the society to
OL,18,Fbuy it back for the community.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
